Third-party components

The terms above apply to this project's own source code and assets only. This
software links against third-party open-source components, each of which
remains under its own license:

  - libgit2 (the C library vendored by the libgit2-sys crate)
    GPL-2.0 WITH a linking exception. The exception gives "unlimited permission
    to link the compiled version of this library into combinations with other
    programs, and to distribute those combinations without any restriction" -
    which is what permits distributing this binary under the terms above.
    Note the git2 / libgit2-sys crates themselves declare MIT OR Apache-2.0;
    that covers the Rust bindings, not the vendored C library.
  - Tauri, wry - Apache-2.0 OR MIT
  - tao - Apache-2.0
  - React, React DOM, react-resizable-panels - MIT

This list names the components that shape the distribution terms; it is not an
exhaustive dependency inventory. The full set, with each package's declared
license, is resolvable from `package.json` / `pnpm-lock.yaml` and
`src-tauri/Cargo.toml` / `src-tauri/Cargo.lock`.
